$Module httparena 3 "HttpArena benchmark helper"

DESCRIPTION
===========

Small helper vmod for HttpArena benchmark endpoints: sums the integer
values found in a URL's query string plus the (POST) request body,
used to answer ``/baseline11``.

$Function STRING baseline_sum(STRING url)

Sum the integer values of every ``key=value`` pair in the query string
of `url`, plus the request body if there is one, and return the total
as a string.
